Hybrid-UniSE Engineering Study

This repository is an independent, substantially modified research snapshot
derived from the Apache-2.0-licensed Alibaba unified-audio / QuarkAudio-UniSE
codebase:

  https://github.com/alibaba/unified-audio/tree/main/QuarkAudio-UniSE

The public snapshot replaces the upstream model factory and adds a
paper-inspired hybrid discriminative-generative implementation, configuration,
documentation, scripts, and tests. It is not an official Alibaba repository or
an official implementation of the Hybrid-UniSE paper.

No upstream demo audio, architecture images, pretrained model weights,
checkpoints, datasets, or private experiment artifacts are redistributed here.
External model assets remain subject to their own licenses; see
docs/provenance.md.
